  "contentHtml": "<p>카메라로 마커를 비춰 가며&#160; 각각의 원소의 특징을 알아 보고, 퍼즐처럼 주기율표 순서대로 맞춰 보는 프로그램이다. <br>일단&#160;간단하게&#160;영상을&#160;보면&#160;사용법을&#160;따로&#160;설명하지&#160;않아도&#160;이해가&#160;될&#160;것이다. <br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/uxHXuOJn0S8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/uxHXuOJn0S8</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uxHXuOJn0S8\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"860\" data-video-height=\"484\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://blog.kakaocdn.net/dna/b3KLFt/hyZODJVSGK/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAABEtKBQMk4B40uVy6L53DWGWiBstfD1fnZ1TcnpYBDZ8/img.jpg?credential=yqXZFxpELC7KVnFOS48ylbz2pIh7yKj8&amp;expires=1767193199&amp;allow_ip=&amp;allow_referer=&amp;signature=lAbzH9BN3W3%2F0ypWbJbAG6crcQw%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"860\" data-video-origin-height=\"484\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uxHXuOJn0S8\" width=\"860\" height=\"484\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><br>20개의&#160;마커를&#160;카메라로&#160;비추면&#160;마커마다&#160;원소명과,&#160;원소기호,&#160;영어&#160;원소명,&#160;사용되는&#160;곳,&#160;원자량&#160;등의&#160;정보가&#160;나온다.&#160; <br><br>스마트기기로&#160;프로그램을&#160;실행하고&#160;마커를&#160;비춰가면서&#160;순서대로&#160;맞추면&#160;된다.&#160; <br>혼자&#160;하는&#160;것&#160;보다,&#160;2명&#160;이상의&#160;모둠원이&#160;합심해서&#160;하는&#160;것이&#160;좋다. <br>(1명은&#160;카메라&#160;비춰&#160;주고,&#160;나머지는&#160;마커&#160;이동시키고...) <br><br>마커를&#160;모둠별로&#160;1장씩&#160;인쇄해&#160;주고&#160;가위로&#160;자르게&#160;한&#160;다음 <br><br>스마트기기를&#160;이용해서&#160;아래&#160;링크를&#160;눌러&#160;실행하면&#160;된다. <br><a href=\"https://sciencej.cafe24.com/html5/arju/arju.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej.cafe24.com/html5/arju/arju.html</a></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e5cd9242244bd19b101a7da4c9f290518e12937\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e5cd9242244bd19b101a7da4c9f290518e12937\" data-origin-width=\"1135\" data-origin-height=\"577\"></div><p><br>가능하면&#160;태블릿을&#160;사용하고,&#160;브라우저는&#160;크롬으로&#160;접속해야&#160;잘&#160;실행&#160;된다. <br>또&#160;화면을&#160;가로모드로&#160;놓고&#160;실행하면&#160;좋다. <br>(가로모드에서&#160;세로모드로&#160;전환하면&#160;위치가&#160;틀어지는&#160;현상이&#160;생긴다.&#160;처음에&#160;세로모드로&#160;실행했으면&#160;끝까지&#160;세로&#160;모드로&#160;진행하는&#160;것이&#160;좋다.&#160;아니면&#160;다시&#160;실행하면&#160;된다) <br><br>주기율표&#160;마커&#160;다운로드</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b64a9b111f5beb3c1b92606b5fbd50e6ccc493a4?download\" data-file-name=\"AR주기율표마커.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"307676\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHq%26dataid%3D1239%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20251202145231&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fb64a9b111f5beb3c1b92606b5fbd50e6ccc493a4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">AR주기율표마커</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">300.46KB</div></div></a></div><p><br><br>마커를&#160;인쇄해&#160;주고&#160;가위로&#160;잘라서&#160;사용하게&#160;하면&#160;된다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a62889cc72e5e86df8203904ec1be725aac4be51\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a62889cc72e5e86df8203904ec1be725aac4be51\" data-origin-width=\"1206\" data-origin-height=\"707\"></div><p><br><br>마커에는&#160;아무&#160;정보도&#160;나오지&#160;않게&#160;했다.&#160; <br>학생들이&#160;마커를&#160;1개씩&#160;비춰&#160;보면서&#160;각&#160;원소의&#160;특징을&#160;찾게&#160;하고&#160;싶었다.&#160;마커에&#160;원소기호가&#160;나오게&#160;하면,&#160;AR주기율표&#160;프로그램&#160;없이도&#160;순서를&#160;맞출&#160;수&#160;있기&#160;때문이다. <br>그리고&#160;마커의&#160;순서도&#160;무작위로&#160;배치해&#160;놓았다.&#160; <br><br>수업시간에&#160;사용할&#160;때&#160;단순하게&#160;순서를&#160;맞추는&#160;것만&#160;하지&#160;말고,&#160;학습지를&#160;주어,&#160;각각의&#160;원소의&#160;특징을&#160;표에&#160;정리하게&#160;하면&#160;좋다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3a688ff679a264725d22528bd97bceeb1296a25\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a3a688ff679a264725d22528bd97bceeb1296a25\" data-origin-width=\"1010\" data-origin-height=\"200\"></div><p><br>한번으로&#160;끝나는게&#160;아니라,&#160;다시&#160;마커를&#160;카드처럼&#160;섞은&#160;다음에,&#160;어떤&#160;모둠이&#160;빨리&#160;맞추는지&#160;시합하게&#160;해도&#160;좋다.&#160;그럼&#160;몇번을&#160;반복해서&#160;게임하게&#160;할&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;단&#160;마커에&#160;낙서하지&#160;않도록&#160;주의를&#160;주자.&#160;마커에&#160;펜을&#160;표시하거나&#160;낙서를&#160;하면,&#160;인식이&#160;안될&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;또&#160;AR주기울표&#160;프로그램&#160;없이&#160;마커만&#160;보고도&#160;맞출&#160;수&#160;있다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>마커를 이용해서 주기율표 순서대로 맞추면, 정답입니다 메시지가 나오고, 원소 번호가 위에 표시 된다.&#160;</p><p>이때 마커 순서는 꼭 주기율표 모양이 아니라, 그냥 왼쪽부터 오른쪽 아래로 순서만 맞으면 된다. 몇줄이든 상관 없다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2b64025f078e5ae342d26bb4ee57485103e6436\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d2b64025f078e5ae342d26bb4ee57485103e6436\" data-origin-width=\"1413\" data-origin-height=\"730\"></div><p><br><br>마커를&#160;인쇄하는&#160;것도&#160;사실&#160;준비가&#160;많이&#160;필요&#160;하다. <br>그래서&#160;마커를&#160;인쇄하지&#160;않고도&#160;할&#160;수&#160;있게,&#160;마커를&#160;태블릿&#160;상에서&#160;이동시켜&#160;볼&#160;수&#160;있는&#160;프로그램도&#160;만들었다.&#160;아래&#160;링크에서&#160;실행하면&#160;된다. <br><a href=\"https://sciencej.cafe24.com/html5/arju/arjupuzzle.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencej.cafe24.com/html5/arju/arjupuzzle.html</a></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/235133621e6aef3021f48122efafbec86d0f5ee7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/235133621e6aef3021f48122efafbec86d0f5ee7\" data-origin-width=\"1031\" data-origin-height=\"614\"></div><p>인쇄할&#160;시간이&#160;없다면,&#160;태블릿2대를&#160;이용해서&#160;게임할&#160;수&#160;있다. <br>1대의&#160;태블릿에서는&#160;마커를&#160;나오게&#160;해서&#160;이동시키고,&#160;다른&#160;1개의&#160;태블릿으로는&#160;카메라로&#160;비추면서&#160;게임을&#160;진행하면&#160;된다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c619204d1110b135e27332b532c85fab1ea178d2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c619204d1110b135e27332b532c85fab1ea178d2\" data-origin-width=\"1123\" data-origin-height=\"499\"></div><p><br>꼭 수업시간이 아니라 학기말 활동으로도 좋을 듯 하다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>출처: <a href=\"https://sciencelove.com/483106\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sciencelove.com/483106</a> [김정식 허명성의 과학사랑:티스토리]</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}